=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# runall screen-pve9 -------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: Run All. web-01.example.net is a Proxmox VE 9 node: root$
# alone, by key, PermitRootLogin yes; no ufw. hardn.yml: george$
# with a key, port 22, two nameservers, backups on, and$
# enableUnattendedUpgrades, enableUfwSshPolicy, configureDns and$
# disableRootSSH true. hardn runs from root's login.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
# Controls -----------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 Refused: sudo isn't installed, so...$
   -  Firewall             Refused: hardn reads pve-firewall...$
   -  SSH Login            Root key-only$
   -  SSH Auth             Nothing asked$
   -  SSH Port             Already as asked$
   -  AppArmor             Status only$
   -  Auto Updates         updated by hand$
   -  DNS                  Set 2 nameservers$
   -  Backups              Used, not changed$
   -  Environment          Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Plan, review, confirm$
                           [ ] Lockout risk$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

